  "content": "<p>Centrus Energy Corp. is a leading supplier of nuclear fuel and services for the nuclear power industry. The company provides low-enriched uranium (LEU) for commercial nuclear power plants globally and is actively developing High-Assay, Low-Enriched Uranium (HALEU) to support the next generation of advanced nuclear reactors. Centrus operates through two main segments: LEU, which involves the sale of uranium enrichment services, and Technical Solutions, which provides engineering, design, and manufacturing services to government and private sector customers. Headquartered in Bethesda, Maryland, Centrus plays a critical role in the nuclear fuel supply chain and energy security.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Amir%20Vexler\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Amir Vexler</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Vexler has served as President and Chief Executive Officer since January 2024. Previously, he served as President of Orano USA from 2021 to 2023 and held various leadership roles at GE-Hitachi Nuclear Energy, including CEO of Global Nuclear Fuel.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kevin%20Harrill\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kevin Harrill</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President, Chief Financial Officer, and Treasurer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Harrill has served as Senior Vice President, Chief Financial Officer, and Treasurer since 2023. He previously served as Vice President and Controller of the Company from 2018 to 2023.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dennis%20Scott\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dennis Scott</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President, General Counsel, and Secretary</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Scott has served as Senior Vice President, General Counsel, and Secretary since 2021. He joined the Company in 2015 and previously served as Deputy General Counsel.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Larry%20Cutlip\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Larry Cutlip</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President, Field Operations</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Cutlip has served as Senior Vice President, Field Operations since 2021. He has been with the Company and its predecessor since 1981, holding various management positions at the Portsmouth and Paducah sites.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bradley%20Sawatzke\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bradley Sawatzke</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former CEO of Energy Northwest. He has extensive experience in nuclear power plant operations and management.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kirkland%20Donald\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kirkland Donald</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2014</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Admiral Kirkland H. Donald, U.S. Navy (Ret.), has served as Chairman of the Board since 2020. He was the President and Chief Executive Officer of Systems Planning and Analysis, Inc. and served as Director, Naval Nuclear Propulsion Program.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tina%20Jonas\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tina Jonas</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Under Secretary of Defense (Comptroller) and CFO for the Department of Defense. She has held senior positions at United Technologies and Lumina Analytics.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/William%20Madia\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">William Madia</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2014</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Director of Oak Ridge National Laboratory and Pacific Northwest National Laboratory. He is a Vice President Emeritus at Stanford University.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Mikel%20Williams\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Mikel Williams</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2014</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Williams has served as Chairman of the Board since 2021. He was previously the CEO of JPS Industries, Inc. and DDi Corp.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Amir%20Vexler\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Amir Vexler</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and CEO of Centrus Energy Corp.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bradley%20Sawatzke\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bradley Sawatzke</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former CEO of Energy Northwest. He has extensive experience in nuclear power plant operations and management.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tina%20Jonas\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tina Jonas</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Under Secretary of Defense (Comptroller) and CFO for the Department of Defense. She has held senior positions at United Technologies and Lumina Analytics.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/William%20Madia\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">William Madia</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2014</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Director of Oak Ridge National Laboratory and Pacific Northwest National Laboratory. He is a Vice President Emeritus at Stanford University.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kirkland%20Donald\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kirkland Donald</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2014</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Admiral Kirkland H. Donald, U.S. Navy (Ret.), has served as Chairman of the Board since 2020. He was the President and Chief Executive Officer of Systems Planning and Analysis, Inc. and served as Director, Naval Nuclear Propulsion Program.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1058811/000105881124000018/leu-20231231.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Centrus Energy Corp. Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-02-21)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1058811/000119312524111304/d783100ddef14a.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Centrus Energy Corp. Definitive Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-04-24)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.centrusenergy.com/about-us/leadership-governance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Centrus Energy Corp. Official Website - Leadership and Governance</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li></ul>"
